---
export const prerender = true;
import ChatWidget from '../components/ChatWidget';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Video script outline</title>
	</head>
	<body class="mx-auto max-w-2xl p-8 font-mono">
		<h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Video script outline</h1>
		<hr class="mt-4 w-16 border-t-2" />

		<ol class="mt-8 space-y-4">
			<li class="flex gap-4">
				<span class="w-8 shrink-0 tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">I.</span>
				<span>What is a harness?</span>
			</li>
			<li class="flex gap-4">
				<span class="w-8 shrink-0 tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">II.</span>
				<span>What is running a harness in a cloud environment?</span>
			</li>
			<li class="flex gap-4">
				<span class="w-8 shrink-0 tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">III.</span>
				<span>What is this example running in Cloudflare's sandbox SDK?</span>
			</li>
			<li class="flex gap-4">
				<span class="w-8 shrink-0 tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">IV.</span>
				<span>What is the Billiam example?</span>
			</li>
			<li class="flex gap-4">
				<span class="w-8 shrink-0 tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">V.</span>
				<span>Claude</span>
			</li>
			<li class="flex gap-4">
				<span class="w-8 shrink-0 tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">VI.</span>
				<span>ChatGPT</span>
			</li>
		</ol>

		<ChatWidget client:load />
	</body>
</html>
